{"id":"H0036","lemma":"אֲבִיטוּב","transliteration":"avituv","sayIt":"a-vi-TUV","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Abitub","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ch.8.11;\nson of: Shaharaim (H7842) and Hushim (H2366A);\nbrother of: Jobab (H3103J), Zibia (H6644), Mesha (H4331), Malcam (H4445A), Jeuz (H3263), Sachia (H7634), Mirmah (H4821) and Elpaal (H0508)\n§ Abitub = \"my father is good(ness)\"\nson of Shaharaim, a Benjamite","glosses":["abitub"],"count":1,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-8","v":11,"renderings":{"bsb":"Abitub","kjv":"Abitub"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 8:11","note":"By Hushim, he became the father of Abitub and Elpaal.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H7842","lemma":"שַׁחֲרַ֫יִם","transliteration":"shacharayim","gloss":"Shaharaim"},{"id":"H2366","lemma":"חוּשִׁים","transliteration":"chushim","gloss":"Hushim"},{"id":"H3103","lemma":"יוֹבָב","transliteration":"yovav","gloss":"Jobab"},{"id":"H6644","lemma":"צִבְיָא","transliteration":"tsivya","gloss":"Zibia"},{"id":"H4331","lemma":"מֵישָׁא","transliteration":"mesah","gloss":"Mesha"},{"id":"H4445","lemma":"מַלְכָּם","transliteration":"malkam","gloss":"Malcam"},{"id":"H3263","lemma":"יְעוּץ","transliteration":"yeuts","gloss":"Jeuz"},{"id":"H7634","lemma":"שָֽׂכְיָה","transliteration":"shovyah","gloss":"Sachia"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}